  "goodToKnow": "Die Schnecke is a snail (with shell) or slug (die Nacktschnecke, naked snail), a gardener's enemy. Im Schneckentempo means at a snail's pace, and jemanden zur Schnecke machen means to give someone a severe dressing-down. In baking, Schnecken are spiral pastries: Zimtschnecken, Nussschnecken. Die Schneckenpost is snail mail. Plural: die Schnecken."
